  "_type": "reference"
 },
 "body": [
  {
   "_key": "000000000001",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000000",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January is an easy month to travel Egypt."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000003",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "v1464mxwfu22",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Without summer's harsh heat, you can combine "
    },
    {
     "_key": "kpe0gaudlhss",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "svysu0z32ns0"
     ],
     "text": "Cairo"
    },
    {
     "_key": "urbtq7da4g44",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", "
    },
    {
     "_key": "ot6gpsg76u11",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "nzo9x5nw96e3"
     ],
     "text": "Luxor"
    },
    {
     "_key": "mte5rz0x76io",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", "
    },
    {
     "_key": "gmpl1g9o2zmd",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "cj5fgvaukrqp"
     ],
     "text": "Aswan"
    },
    {
     "_key": "jwv57g5ca0jx",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Red Sea, and desert into one itinerary. Walk the pyramids and temples longer. Tire less in the "
    },
    {
     "_key": "vgyrhw4y3mu8",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "q6d45a6bklx0"
     ],
     "text": "Valley of the Kings"
    },
    {
     "_key": "8a8laf5ua2s8",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ". Spend pleasant time on Nile cruise decks. Reach the Western Desert realistically."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "svysu0z32ns0",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "nzo9x5nw96e3",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "cj5fgvaukrqp",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "q6d45a6bklx0",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.valley-of-the-kings",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000005",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000004",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "But January isn't just \"a warm, empty month.\""
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000007",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000006",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In Egypt's tourism calendar, January is popular. Weather is good — main sites, hotels, and Nile cruises crowd. Morning and night are colder than expected in some areas, and desert nights truly cold."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000009",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000008",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "To enjoy January Egypt well, understand not only good climate but regional difference, crowds, dress, and booking timing."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000000a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January Egypt varies a lot by region"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000000c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Egypt runs long north to south, and January climate isn't one thing."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000000f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "6cukvkixsljb",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cairo and "
    },
    {
     "_key": "jz2qdkxpni6o",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "kz7p5d9j2zpm"
     ],
     "text": "Giza"
    },
    {
     "_key": "o56azc7pk5vm",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " pass comfortably by day but cool morning and night. "
    },
    {
     "_key": "mbguou11kxz4",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "sehqej5zaaze"
     ],
     "text": "The Giza plateau"
    },
    {
     "_key": "921glk8kro5k",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " catches wind, so a jacket helps for early pyramid visits. Rain is rare, but winter is Egypt's relatively rain-possible season."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "kz7p5d9j2zpm",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "sehqej5zaaze",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.giza.the-giza-plateau",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000011",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "axk9cooylkfb",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Luxor is very walkable in January. Valley of the Kings, Karnak, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "sgb45cbkp3ie",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "23t72782zsz5"
     ],
     "text": "Luxor Temple"
    },
    {
     "_key": "kledjkmwjpoq",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", and west-bank mortuary temples take far less toll than summer. Daytime warm, mornings and nights cool — light layers fit."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "23t72782zsz5",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.the-luxor-temple",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000013",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "jkv0cvihapyb",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Aswan is warmer still, with winter sun and Nile scenery matching well. Philae, Nubian villages, felucca, and "
    },
    {
     "_key": "t4ltvkl6zj3l",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "z6t3z446z2er"
     ],
     "text": "Abu Simbel"
    },
    {
     "_key": "ulxcvp5jxpmx",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "-direction itineraries pack without heat pressure."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "z6t3z446z2er",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-56813",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000015",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000014",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The Red Sea coast feels comfortable by day, but water can feel cold for sea-bath-only purposes. Good for diving and snorkelling but plan thermal protection for long water time."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000017",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000016",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Western Desert and White Desert are very attractive in January. Daytime walks well, summer-impossible desert stays become realistic. But nights are cold. For desert overnight, warm clothing and bedding needed."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000019",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000018",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Why January suits site touring"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000001a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Egypt's main sites involve long outdoor walking."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000001c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Giza, Saqqara, Karnak, Valley of the Kings, Hatshepsut, Philae, Abu Simbel. All take heavy stamina in hot seasons."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000001f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000001e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January eases this load greatly. Sun shines, but air is dry and cool, walking easy from morning into early afternoon. Without rushing, you have margin to see temple columns, wall paintings, and tomb details."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000021",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000020",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In Luxor the difference shows largest. Summer Valley of the Kings holds heat inside and out — short time tires. January lets you compare multiple tombs or spend a day on the west bank."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000023",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000022",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Egypt's ancient sites deepen with walking distance, not just looking. January is the season that permits that walking time."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000025",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000024",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "But crowds exist"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000027",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000026",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January is a popular season."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000029",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000028",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "European and North American winter holiday travel, year-end momentum, Egyptian domestic holidays, and Coptic Christmas overlap — main sites crowd."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "d4thoelnecpa",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Giza pyramids, Valley of the Kings, Karnak, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "xqek39lu7kj8",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "rsqxi7jp0lm9"
     ],
     "text": "Edfu"
    },
    {
     "_key": "ghkct2yupmxt",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": " Temple, Philae — group tours fill from mid-morning. Nile cruises move on similar schedules, concentrating people at specific sites."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "rsqxi7jp0lm9",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-58841",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000002c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The fix is simple."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000002f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000002e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Move as early as possible."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000031",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000030",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Hit Giza at opening. Enter Valley of the Kings early morning. Push Karnak to morning or evening. Abu Simbel often departs early morning anyway, but choose tours that adjust to people flow."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000033",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000032",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January sites themselves are wonderful. Crowd-avoidance technique decides how much you receive."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000035",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000034",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January dress"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000037",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000036",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Summer clothes alone don't cut it in January."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000039",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000038",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Daytime can pass in light long sleeve or short sleeve, but mornings and nights cool. Especially in Cairo, Giza, desert, and Nile-cruise decks, wind drops felt temperature."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Base is layering."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Light long sleeve, walkable pants, light jacket, warm morning/evening cover. For desert overnight, add fleece or down and warm socks."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000003f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000003e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Choose footwear suited to site walking. Sand, stone steps, unpaved road, ship boarding — walkability over looks matters."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000041",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000040",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sunscreen, hat, sunglasses needed. Winter Egyptian sun is strong — being cool tempts off-guard sunburn. Dry air means stay hydrated."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000043",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000042",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cairo and Giza in January"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000045",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000044",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January Cairo is good walkability-wise."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000047",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "f57q3zetfzmw",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Giza pyramids, Saqqara, Islamic district, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "v15dexvgfcs8",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "8spaylvcknke"
     ],
     "text": "Coptic Cairo"
    },
    {
     "_key": "r30jwbxgmbre",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", "
    },
    {
     "_key": "qrz6agp6sp37",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "z39gp8dqaevx"
     ],
     "text": "Khan el-Khalili"
    },
    {
     "_key": "zwo2yvebxtez",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", and the Grand Egyptian Museum combine easily. Unlike summer, transfers don't exhaust through heat each time."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "8spaylvcknke",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "wp-page-63606",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "z39gp8dqaevx",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.cairo.khan-el-khalili",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000049",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000048",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Visiting the Grand Egyptian Museum, secure substantial time. Per the official ticketing site, a visit includes the Tutankhamun Galleries, the Main Galleries, the Grand Hall, and the Khufu Boat Museum. Rather than a quick add-on, half a day or more fits."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For Giza pyramids, early morning especially recommended. Soft light, low temperature, fewer people likely. Afternoon visits show beautiful evening light but watch traffic and closing time."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Coptic Cairo has special meaning in early January. Coptic Christmas falls 7 January, with church and surrounding atmosphere shifting from usual. At religious occasions, quiet tourist respect matters."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000004f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000004e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Luxor in January"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000051",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000050",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January Luxor sits naturally at the centre of an Egypt trip."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000053",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "7q8kfp5y9b5n",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Valley of the Kings, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "dab01jhujh30",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "rft3so5exj8u"
     ],
     "text": "Valley of the Queens"
    },
    {
     "_key": "1akexqnpsleo",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", nobles' tombs, Hatshepsut, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "gkmuxtx6ff9t",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "7pfw7rtglrmy"
     ],
     "text": "Medinet Habu"
    },
    {
     "_key": "3nlufd2emk4v",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", Karnak, and Luxor Temple — seeing these in short time gets large help from a low-heat season."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "rft3so5exj8u",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.valley-of-the-queens",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    },
    {
     "_key": "7pfw7rtglrmy",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.madinat-habu-temple",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000055",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000054",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "At minimum two nights, ideally three or more, lets you split east and west banks. January travels well but holds people too — morning-time use matters."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000057",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000056",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Valley of the Kings: standard tickets cover some tombs, supplementary tickets cover others. Tutankhamun's tomb, Seti I's tomb, and Ramses V/VI's tomb can change handling — confirm on-site."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000059",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000058",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "In Luxor, building in midday rest helps. Early sites, afternoon hotel or Nile-side rest, Luxor Temple in the evening. Even in January, this rhythm treats the body gently."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Aswan and Abu Simbel"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000005c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January Aswan is warm, calm, easy to place at trip's end."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000005f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0qbyjyybkav3",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Philae, Unfinished Obelisk, Nubian villages, "
    },
    {
     "_key": "yql7gxz6vmv3",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [
      "fe2bq6sx5cea"
     ],
     "text": "Elephantine Island"
    },
    {
     "_key": "8ncbuxpelq29",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": ", felucca, Nile-side evening. Slower-time feel than Luxor, suited to combining sites and rest."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [
    {
     "_key": "fe2bq6sx5cea",
     "_type": "internalLink",
     "reference": {
      "_ref": "guideArticle.aswan.elephantine-island",
      "_type": "reference"
     }
    }
   ],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000061",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000060",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Abu Simbel often means early-morning departure. January reduces heat burden, easing long transfers — still a full day. Aswan minimum two nights reduces strain."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000063",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000062",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For Nile cruise, January is very popular. Ship choice, cabin, price, and guide quality vary — early booking and content confirmation matter."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000065",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000064",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "How to think about Red Sea in January"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000067",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000066",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "The Red Sea coast remains a viable January destination."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000069",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000068",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Sharm el-Sheikh, Dahab, Hurghada, El Gouna, Marsa Alam — daytime passable, seaside rest fits. Without summer heat, spa, walking, boating, light activity combine easily."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "But water temperature can feel cold. For diving or snorkelling, confirm wetsuit and thermal advice in advance."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Thinking Red Sea as \"swim-all-day beach holiday\" — spring or autumn fit some better. As several rest days after site touring, January Red Sea is quite usable."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000006f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000006e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Desert and oases"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000071",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000070",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January is a month easy to fit desert into the itinerary."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000073",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000072",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "White Desert, Black Desert, Bahariya, Farafra, Siwa — summer heat creates big problems. Winter makes daytime movement and walking easy; desert overnight realistic."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000075",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000074",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "White Desert nights are beautiful but cold. Starry sky and moonlight scenes impress, but light clothing won't enjoy them. For desert tours, confirm bedding, warmth, vehicle, guide, permits, food, water, emergency contact."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000077",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000076",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Siwa works for quiet January stay. Salt lakes, springs, Shali old town, dunes, oasis scenery — enjoyable without heat. Cairo transfer is long — secure days rather than forcing into short trips."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000079",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000078",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Booking and cost"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000007b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000007a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January is popular — booking early gives peace of mind."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000007d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000007c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Especially Nile cruises, well-rated Luxor and Aswan hotels, popular Giza hotels, and year-end-through-early-January lodging fill early. Small dahabiyas and boutique stays have few rooms — earlier confirmation needed."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000007f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000007e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Prices run higher than summer off-season. For cheapest, other seasons are candidates; for avoiding heat and efficient wide travel, January value is high."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000081",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000080",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "At booking, confirm cancellation, transfer, fees, tips, guide, meals, and domestic flight/train handling. Egyptian travel products vary widely in included/excluded."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000083",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000082",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January-suited itineraries"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000085",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000084",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "For first-time Egypt, Cairo, Luxor, and Aswan as axis is natural."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000087",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000086",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Around a week: Cairo and Giza two or three days, Luxor two or three days, Aswan one or two days. With margin, add Abu Simbel or Nile cruise."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000089",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000088",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Ten days or more: add Red Sea rest days, or White Desert or Siwa. Don't pack all — January is a high-option month, so priority-setting matters."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000008b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000008a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Weighing sites — thicken Luxor days."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000008d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000008c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Weighing museum and pyramids — give Cairo and Giza margin."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000008f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000008e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Adding rest — place Aswan or Red Sea at trip's back half."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000091",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000090",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Adding desert — count transfer days and warm-clothing as separate budget."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000093",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000092",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Composed this way, January goodness applies without strain."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000095",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000094",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January cautions"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000097",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000096",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "First, morning and night cold. Egypt's hot-country image alone surprises in Cairo or desert."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "000000000099",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "000000000098",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Second, crowds. At main sites, use early-time, avoid midday peaks, and plan popular tombs or museums in advance."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000009b",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000009a",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Third, sun. Winter still needs sunscreen and hat. Cool wind hides sunburn and dehydration."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000009d",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000009c",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Last, religious and political memorial-day consideration. Around Coptic Christmas on 7 January, church and road crowds change. 25 January is an important modern-history day; by year, city atmosphere or movement can shift. Move with latest local information."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "00000000009f",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "00000000009e",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Who January Egypt suits"
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "h2"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000a1",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a0",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January Egypt suits people wanting to see sites thoroughly."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000a3",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a2",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Heat-averse, travelling with older family, with children on long outdoor visits, wanting comfortable Nile cruise, considering desert too — all suited."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000a5",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a4",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Conversely, those seeking empty sites only, prioritising long sea-swim, or chasing lowest price may find other months better."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000a7",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a6",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January opens many Egyptian regions simultaneously. Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, Red Sea, desert — all become realistic options."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000a9",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000a8",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Which means it's also a month of too many options."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000ab",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000aa",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "To make a good trip, don't try to fit all. Decide first what you most want to see, where to rest, which transfers to cut. Then January Egypt becomes a strong ally."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000ad",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000ac",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cool morning pyramids."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000af",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000ae",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Walkable Valley of the Kings."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000b1",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000b0",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Evening Nile."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000b3",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000b2",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "Cold desert stars."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  },
  {
   "_key": "0000000000b5",
   "_type": "block",
   "children": [
    {
     "_key": "0000000000b4",
     "_type": "span",
     "marks": [],
     "text": "January is one of few seasons that can hold all these in one trip."
    }
   ],
   "markDefs": [],
   "style": "normal"
  }
 ],
